        <mxCell id="23" value="1. Client submits complaint to API Gateway&#xa;2. Ingest Lambda stores raw payload in S3&#xa;3. Ingest publishes `ComplaintReceived`&#xa;4. Analyze Lambda reads S3 and calls Bedrock&#xa;5. Analysis is normalized into DynamoDB&#xa;6. Analyze publishes `ComplaintAnalyzed`&#xa;7. Action Lambda simulates escalation logic" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
